direction: right
Developer: Developer {shape: person}
Git: Source repository {shape: document}
CI: CI runner {shape: rectangle}
Tests: Test suite {shape: diamond}
Scan: Security scan {shape: rectangle}
Registry: Artifact registry {shape: package}
GitOps: Deployment config {shape: document}
CD: CD controller {shape: rectangle}
Production: Production cluster {shape: cloud}
Monitor: Monitoring {shape: rectangle}
Developer -> Git: push
Git -> CI: webhook
CI -> Tests
Tests -> Scan: passed
Scan -> Registry
Registry -> GitOps: release digest
GitOps -> CD
CD -> Production
Production -> Monitor
Monitor -> CD: rollback signal
